	(text "【参数计算 — 绿通道 · DC 调光】\n调光方式：CTRL 加 0.4~2.5 V 直流（analog / DC dimming），不是 PWM\nI_LED(100%) = 0.1/0.30 = 333 mA；ΔI = 26 mV/R_SET = 86.6 mA（VSET_HYS = ±13%，固定值）\nV_LED = 4×3.2 V = 12.8 V（Vf 2.8~3.5 V，取典型 3.2）\nt_OFF = 100µ×86.6m/(12.8+0.5+0.13) = 650 ns\nt_ON = 8.66µ/(24−12.8−0.13) = 783 ns → f_SW = 698 kHz（满载 CCM）\n调暗到 10%：纹波仍 ~86.6 mA > 平均 33 mA → 进 DCM，频率下降（与手册“负载范围内校核 on/off 时间”一致）\nP_R_SET = 0.033 W；单颗灯珠约 1.1 W，焊盘铺铜按 3535 规格书"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 166.37 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "079ffccb-b27b-46d0-991a-9d70cb29f79c")
	)
	(text "【原理】AL8862 滞环降压：VIN → R_SET → LED 串 → L → SW；开关关断时 D17(SW→VIN) 续流\n【LAYOUT】SW→L/D 走线最短以降低 EMI；EP 大面积铺铜 + 散热过孔；R_SET 与 VIN/SET 用 Kelvin 接法\n【焊接】3535 灯珠回流焊 240±5℃/6s，只建议返修时手工焊（<300℃/3s）"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.354 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a7a9ec67-5c6e-466c-8faf-d14bc1152fb9")
	)
